WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:06.359 align:start position:19%
the biceps get a lot of attention and
for good reason simply growing this one

00:00:04.279 --> 00:00:10.679 align:start position:19%
muscle can make a dramatic difference in
how jacked you look in a t-shirt so in

00:00:08.719 --> 00:00:14.599 align:start position:19%
this video I'll be covering the best and
