00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:05.199 align:start position:19%
called the Breaky Alis and it's actually
just as big as both heads of the biceps

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:10.439 align:start position:19%
combined and it can also help push the
biceps up more creating bigger Peaks so

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:14.280 align:start position:19%
it's an important muscle and as we go
we'll consider which variations will

